# CLARION CALL: proof the game can be completed, the lonely way. The demo
# player takes the yellow key from the Cellars' second cave, goes to
# Cogtown and spends the key on its yellow door: a shortcut to the Spire
# that leaves Cogtown's Hush Engine standing. Lady Hush falls, Clary
# escapes, and Ansel stays behind: no Saucer goal.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 20
cheat bot_goal 2
botuntil state == 2 600
botuntil area_no >= 3 40000
expect key == 1
botuntil region == 4 40000
botuntil region == 6 40000
expect shortcut == 1
expect engines == 3
botuntil world_kind == 2 60000
botuntil state == 9 20000
expect ending == 1
expect goals !& 2
expect wins_bad == 1
